        *   **Behind the Scenes**: ChromaDB uses `EMBEDDING_FUNCTION_GEMINI.__call__` to embed the query text. It then performs a vector similarity search against the embeddings of the stored policy chunks to find the closest matches.
        *   The results (a dictionary containing `documents`, `ids`, `distances`, etc.) are assigned to `policy_results`.
